{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894250/extras/12ccc5a902f522121653b89e8dabd8c6.poster.avif?t=1771439401\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894250/extras/12ccc5a902f522121653b89e8dabd8c6.webm?t=1771439401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894250/extras/12ccc5a902f522121653b89e8dabd8c6.mp4?t=1771439401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Objective:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get the Star safely to the Ground</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on other Blocks to remove them or interact with them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let Gravity and Physics do its work</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894250/extras/f23c01eab776ce25410a35d242b97c93.poster.avif?t=1771439401\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894250/extras/f23c01eab776ce25410a35d242b97c93.webm?t=1771439401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894250/extras/f23c01eab776ce25410a35d242b97c93.mp4?t=1771439401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level Editor &amp; Online Levels:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Level Sizes and Visual Styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various fun Game Mechanics (Hazards, Bombs, Moving Platforms, Portals &amp; More)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make fun, creative and exciting levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upload and Share your level with others online</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play levels made by others!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894250/extras/f526f2ff4ebb3b7dc71fac45e2979e16.poster.avif?t=1771439401\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894250/extras/f526f2ff4ebb3b7dc71fac45e2979e16.webm?t=1771439401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894250/extras/f526f2ff4ebb3b7dc71fac45e2979e16.mp4?t=1771439401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 Starter Levels to play - Giving you chance to learn the mechanics and have some fun. 50 of them will be remixed from the original game with 50 brand new ones made for Builder Edition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50 Bonus Levels - Even more free levels to enjoy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level Editor: Create and share your own unique levels with friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Block Database: Play more levels online from around the world from strangers and friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can be played locally with friend with 2 controllers for puzzle co-op solving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cloud Saves - Sync up your levels across devices as well as with the Main Version</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894250/ex